#ASSERT `the limb that decides the non-entity case` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` `not on the register` (LIST `pf: education`) `no permission` `the Chief Minister` `the proper determination that the entity provides public benefit` FALSE EQUALS `Article 5(1) does not apply: the body is not an entity within Article 2(1)`
#ASSERT `the limb that decides the non-entity case` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` `not on the register` (LIST `pf: no head`) `no permission` `the Chief Minister` `the determination made by presuming public benefit` FALSE EQUALS `Article 5(1) does not apply: the body is not an entity within Article 2(1)`
#ASSERT `the limb that decides the non-entity case` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` `not on the register` EMPTY `no permission` `the Chief Minister` `the proper determination that the entity provides public benefit` FALSE EQUALS `Article 5(1) does not apply: the body is not an entity within Article 2(1)`

