#TRACE `Art 5(6) the Commissioner must consult and publish a report before issuing or amending guidance` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`consult` `the Commissioner` FALSE TRUE TRUE) AT 1

-- Consulted but no report yet: the duty to publish the report stands.
-- EXPECT: STANDING publish a report
#TRACE `Art 5(6) the Commissioner must consult and publish a report before issuing or amending guidance` TRUE TRUE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`consult` `the Commissioner` TRUE TRUE TRUE) AT 1

-- Where no one appears representative and the Commissioner considers no other persons appropriate, consulting the Minister suffices.
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 5(6) the Commissioner must consult and publish a report before issuing or amending guidance` FALSE FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`consult` `the Commissioner` FALSE TRUE FALSE) AT 1
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`publish a report on the views on the consultation and the reasons for the decision on the guidance` `the Commissioner`) AT 3

-- FORK F2.7, "before issuing or amending guidance".  Guidance issued on 20 January 2026.
-- The consultation on 10 January and the report on 15 January are before it on both readings.
#ASSERT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 10)) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 15))
#ASSERT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.7 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 10)) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 15))
-- The discriminating case: the report published on the day the guidance is issued.  Strictly earlier (taken): not before.  The other reading: it may fall on that day.
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 10)) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 20))
#ASSERT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.7 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 10)) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 20))
-- The consultation on the day the guidance is issued (and the report the same day).
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 20)) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 20))
#ASSERT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.7 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 20)) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 20))
-- The day before is before, on both readings; the day after is not, on either.
#ASSERT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 18)) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 19))
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.7 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 18)) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 21))
-- The report cannot precede the consultation it reports on.
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 15)) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 10))
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.7 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 15)) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 10))
-- Consultation and report on the same earlier day.
#ASSERT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 10)) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 10))
-- Not yet held or published.
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 20) NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2026 1 10))
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(6) the consultation and the report preceded the guidance` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 20) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 10)) NOTHING

§§ `Article 5(7): providing the Minister with the guidance and the report`

GIVETH AN `Interpretation of Articles 3 to 7`
`the interpretation with days measured and the day of the event counted` MEANS
    `Interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` OF `F2.1 A`, `F2.2 A`, `F2.3 A`, `F2.4 B`, `F2.5 A`, `F2.6 B`, `F2.7 A`, `F2.8 A`, `F2.9 A`, `F2.10 A`, `F2.11 A`, `F2.12 A`, `F2.13 A`, `F2.14 A`

-- src:164 | (7) Within a reasonable time after issuing or amending guidance the Commissioner must provide to the Minister a copy of the issued or amended guidance and the report published under paragraph (6)(b).
-- FORK F2.4, first reading (taken): the time is an input judgement; the number of days is not read.  Guidance issued 1 January 2026.
#ASSERT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 15)) TRUE 30
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 15)) FALSE 30
-- The discriminating case of F2.4: guidance issued 1 January 2026, copy given 1 March 2026, N = 30.  First reading: whatever the input says.  Second: late.
#ASSERT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) TRUE 30
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) TRUE 30
-- Not yet provided: not in time, on either reading.
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 1) NOTHING TRUE 30
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 1) NOTHING TRUE 30
-- Second reading, the day of the event not counted (F2.6 first reading, taken): day 30 after 1 January is 31 January; 1 February is day 31.
#ASSERT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 31)) FALSE 30
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 2 1)) TRUE 30
-- The same day as the issue is within the period; the day before is not "after" it.
#ASSERT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 1)) FALSE 30
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2025 12 31)) TRUE 30
-- FORK F2.6, second reading: the day of the event is the first day, so day 30 is 30 January.
#ASSERT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the interpretation with days measured and the day of the event counted` (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 30)) FALSE 30
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the interpretation with days measured and the day of the event counted` (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 1 31)) TRUE 30
-- F2.6 is read only when days are counted: on the first reading of F2.4 it changes nothing.
#ASSERT `Art 5(7) the Commissioner provided the Minister with the guidance and the report in time` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.6 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) TRUE 30

-- The duty as a regulative rule.  First reading: no period is stated, so the duty stands until it is performed.
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 5(7) the Commissioner must provide the Minister with the guidance and the report` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 1) 30 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 1 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`provide to the Minister a copy of the issued or amended guidance and the report` `the Commissioner`) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 6 1))

-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `Art 5(7) the Commissioner must provide the Minister with the guidance and the report` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 1 1) 30 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 1 1)) WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2027 1 1)))

-- Second reading, day not counted: the copy on day 30 (31 January) is in time; on day 31 (1 February) it is late.
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 5(7) the Commissioner must provide the Minister with the guidance and the report` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 1) 30 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 1 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`provide to the Minister a copy of the issued or amended guidance and the report` `the Commissioner`) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 1 31))

-- EXPECT: BREACH Article 5(7)
#TRACE `Art 5(7) the Commissioner must provide the Minister with the guidance and the report` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 1 1) 30 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 1 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`provide to the Minister a copy of the issued or amended guidance and the report` `the Commissioner`) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 2 1))

-- Second reading, the day of the event counted: day 30 is 30 January.
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 5(7) the Commissioner must provide the Minister with the guidance and the report` `the interpretation with days measured and the day of the event counted` (YMD 2026 1 1) 30 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 1 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`provide to the Minister a copy of the issued or amended guidance and the report` `the Commissioner`) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 1 30))

-- EXPECT: BREACH Article 5(7)
#TRACE `Art 5(7) the Commissioner must provide the Minister with the guidance and the report` `the interpretation with days measured and the day of the event counted` (YMD 2026 1 1) 30 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 1 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Commissioner` DOES (`provide to the Minister a copy of the issued or amended guidance and the report` `the Commissioner`) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 1 31))

§§ `Article 5(8): laying the guidance and the report before the States`

-- src:165 | (8) The Minister must lay a copy of the guidance and report so provided before the States as soon as practicable after the Minister receives the guidance and report.
-- Guidance and report received by the Minister on 1 March 2026.  First reading: an input judgement.
#ASSERT `Art 5(8) the Minister laid the guidance and the report before the States in time` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 3 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 10)) TRUE 14
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(8) the Minister laid the guidance and the report before the States in time` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 3 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 10)) FALSE 14
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(8) the Minister laid the guidance and the report before the States in time` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 3 1) NOTHING TRUE 14
-- Second reading, N = 14, the day of receipt not counted: 15 March is day 14; 16 March is day 15.
#ASSERT `Art 5(8) the Minister laid the guidance and the report before the States in time` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 3 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 15)) FALSE 14
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(8) the Minister laid the guidance and the report before the States in time` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 3 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 16)) TRUE 14
-- A copy laid before the guidance was received is not "after" receipt.
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(8) the Minister laid the guidance and the report before the States in time` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 3 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 2 28)) TRUE 14
-- The day of receipt counted: 14 March is day 14.
#ASSERT `Art 5(8) the Minister laid the guidance and the report before the States in time` `the interpretation with days measured and the day of the event counted` (YMD 2026 3 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 14)) FALSE 14
#ASSERT NOT `Art 5(8) the Minister laid the guidance and the report before the States in time` `the interpretation with days measured and the day of the event counted` (YMD 2026 3 1) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 15)) TRUE 14

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 5(8) the Minister must lay the guidance and the report before the States` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 3 1) 14 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES (`lay a copy of the guidance and report before the States` `the Minister`) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 9 1))

-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `Art 5(8) the Minister must lay the guidance and the report before the States` `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` (YMD 2026 3 1) 14 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1)) WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2027 3 1)))

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 5(8) the Minister must lay the guidance and the report before the States` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 3 1) 14 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES (`lay a copy of the guidance and report before the States` `the Minister`) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 15))

-- EXPECT: BREACH Article 5(8)
#TRACE `Art 5(8) the Minister must lay the guidance and the report before the States` `the interpretation of Articles 3 to 7 with F2.4 read as B` (YMD 2026 3 1) 14 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES (`lay a copy of the guidance and report before the States` `the Minister`) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 16))

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Art 5(8) the Minister must lay the guidance and the report before the States` `the interpretation with days measured and the day of the event counted` (YMD 2026 3 1) 14 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES (`lay a copy of the guidance and report before the States` `the Minister`) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 14))

-- EXPECT: BREACH Article 5(8)
#TRACE `Art 5(8) the Minister must lay the guidance and the report before the States` `the interpretation with days measured and the day of the event counted` (YMD 2026 3 1) 14 AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES (`lay a copy of the guidance and report before the States` `the Minister`) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 15))
